<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buyback to re-start shortly.</title>
<headline>Telecom buyback to re-start shortly.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Wednesday that stage two of its share buyback was due to start shortly.  </p>
<p>In the first phase of a planned NZ$1 billion repurchase the company bought nearly 55 million shares for more than $350 million in February and March.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
